OL,3,AFirms told to publish salaries in job
OL,4,Aadverts ahead of new law
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses should publish salaries in
OL,7,Fjob adverts now, Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham is telling firms, rather than
OL,9,Fwait for a new law to come in that will
OL,10,Fforce them to do so.
OL,12,FThe government is planning to make pay
OL,13,Fdetails compulsory in adverts, with
OL,14,Flegislation on the issue being brought
OL,15,Fforward "as soon as possible".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
